OL,3,GNEWSACouncil has more than 100 cameras
OL,4,Awith facial recognition capability
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston City Council has more than 100
OL,7,FCCTV cameras with facial recognition
OL,8,Ftechnology enabled, according to
OL,9,Finformation disclosed through a Freedom
OL,10,Fof Information (FOI) request by Liberty
OL,11,FInvestigates.
OL,13,FThe council said that, of its 130
OL,14,Fcameras, a facial recognition watchlist
OL,15,Fis used on just one, inside its One
OL,16,FStop Shop at Preston Town Hall.
OL,18,FA watchlist contains images of people
OL,19,Fthe system is looking for and can alert
OL,20,Foperators to a potential match.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
