OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil has more than 100 cameras
OL,4,Awith facial recognition capability
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston City Council said it uses the
OL,7,Ftechnology to help deter and detect
OL,8,Fcrime and anti-social behaviour. It
OL,9,Fadded that facial recognition
OL,10,Fwatchlists are not used across the
OL,11,Fwider CCTV network and that it has "no
OL,12,Fplans to expand its use".
